    "probe_text": "Here is the complete ordered sequence for `POST /api/owners`, handled by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner` (the V2 controller adds no create). The controller method is **not** `@Transactional`, so every `clinicService` call below runs in its own separate transaction \u2014 there is no single atomic boundary around the create.\n\n## Before the controller body runs\n\n1. **Security filter chain** *(side-effect / gate)* \u2014 only when `petclinic.security.enable=true`: HTTP Basic auth, `anyRequest().authenticated()`.\n2. **Bean Validation on `OwnerFieldsDto`** *(validation)* \u2014 the `@Valid @RequestBody` on the generated `OwnersApi` interface triggers before the method body: `firstName`/`lastName` (`@NotNull`, name `@Pattern`, `@Size 1\u201330`), `city` (`@NotNull`, `@Size 1\u201380`), `telephone` (`@NotNull`, `@Size 1\u201320`), `email` (`@Email`, `@Size 1\u2013255`), `address`/`addressLine1`/`addressLine2` (`@Size 1\u2013255`), `postcode` (`@Pattern ^[0-9]{4}$`). Failure \u2192 **400**. (Note: the `Owner` *entity's* own constraints are never re-validated on the save path.)\n3. **Authorization** *(validation/gate)* \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` requires `ROLE_OWNER_ADMIN` \u2192 else 403/401.\n\n## Inside `addOwner`, in exact order\n\n4. **Idempotency lookup** *(side-effect: read)* \u2014 reads `Idempotency-Key` header; if previously seen and the owner still exists, returns **200 early** (no new owner) with a `bulkSignupWarning`.\n5. **Address normalization** *(side-effect: transform)* \u2014 trims/collapses whitespace, upper-cases, expands `ST\u2192STREET`, `RD\u2192ROAD`, `AVE\u2192AVENUE`; composes `address` from structured lines or the flat field.\n6. **Required-field presence check** *(validation)* \u2014 `firstName, lastName, address, city, telephone` must be present \u2192 else `MissingOwnerFieldsException` **400**.\n7. **Telephone normalization** *(side-effect: transform + validation)* \u2014 strips separators, applies `+61` default (drops one leading `0`), enforces digit-count rules \u2192 invalid \u2192 `InvalidTelephoneException` **400**.\n8. **Map DTO \u2192 `Owner` entity** *(side-effect)* \u2014 `ownerMapper.toOwner(...)`; note the **email setter lower-cases** the value.\n9. **Override address fields** *(side-effect)* \u2014 sets composed `address` and `addressLine1/2` on the entity.\n10. **Set normalized telephone** *(side-effect)* on the entity.\n11. **Email-domain check** *(validation)* \u2014 rejects disposable domains (`mailinator.com`, `tempmail.com`, `guerrillamail.com`) \u2192 `DisposableEmailDomainException` **400**.\n12. **Postcode range check** *(validation)* \u2014 must fall in the region's range (NSW 2000\u20132099, VIC 3000\u20133099, QLD 4000\u20134099) \u2192 `InvalidPostcodeException` **400**.\n13. **Compute `householdId`** *(side-effect: derive)* \u2014 SHA-256 of `lastName|postcode`, first 12 hex chars, upper-cased.\n14. **Household-duplicate check** *(validation)* \u2014 if `!sharesHousehold` and household already in use (scans `findAllOwners()`) \u2192 `DuplicateIdentityException` **409**.\n15. **Identity-key duplicate check** *(validation)* \u2014 identity key = `telephone|email|householdId`; if in use (scans all owners) \u2192 `DuplicateIdentityException` **409**.\n16. **City-capacity check** *(validation)* \u2014 \u2265 50 owners in that city (scans all) \u2192 `CityAtCapacityException` **409**.\n17. **Future-date check** *(validation)* \u2014 supplied `registrationDate` after today \u2192 `FutureRegistrationDateException` **400**.\n18. **Business-day roll** *(side-effect: transform)* \u2014 rolls the effective registration date forward past weekends and fixed 2026 public holidays.\n19. **Daily-limit check** *(validation)* \u2014 \u2265 100 registrations for that date (scans all) \u2192 `DailyRegistrationLimitException` **429**.\n20. **Set derived entity fields** *(side-effects: derive; each scans all owners)* \u2014\n    - `registrationDate` =